1065
01:03:50,358 --> 01:03:51,877
Large buildings
are coming to life

1066
01:03:52,015 --> 01:03:53,154
and destroying the city.

1067
01:04:02,025 --> 01:04:04,165
Everyone...

1068
01:04:04,303 --> 01:04:05,891
Everyone needs to clear out.

1069
01:04:06,029 --> 01:04:07,203
It is not safe here.

1070
01:04:07,341 --> 01:04:08,928
- That means you, Sarah.
- What?

1071
01:04:09,066 --> 01:04:11,759
And I'm not just saying that
because I'm in love with you.

1072
01:04:11,897 --> 01:04:14,727
You just
said that on live TV.

1073
01:04:14,865 --> 01:04:15,797
Aw.

1074
01:04:15,935 --> 01:04:17,005
All right, fine.

1075
01:04:17,143 --> 01:04:18,869
I-I'm in love with you,
Sarah Hatoff.

1076
01:04:19,007 --> 01:04:20,664
I said it.
Now, get out of here.

1077
01:04:20,802 --> 01:04:22,977
If you think I'm leaving
the biggest story of my life,

1078
01:04:23,115 --> 01:04:25,531
you're an even bigger idiot
than the one I'm in love with.

1079
01:04:25,669 --> 01:04:27,533
You just said that on live TV.

1080
01:04:27,671 --> 01:04:29,501
- Ugh. Fine.
- Fine.

1081
01:04:29,639 --> 01:04:30,847
- Fine.
- Fine!

1082
01:04:30,985 --> 01:04:32,642
Fine!

1083
01:04:35,541 --> 01:04:39,027
And now, my beautiful army,
destroy them.

1084
01:04:39,165 --> 01:04:40,236
Gooba gabba.

1085
01:04:40,374 --> 01:04:42,824
Gooba gabba. Gooba gabba.

1086
01:04:49,003 --> 01:04:50,349
Whoa!

1087
01:05:03,949 --> 01:05:06,607
Gooba gabba.

1088
01:05:13,510 --> 01:05:14,891
Oh, no.

1089
01:05:20,034 --> 01:05:21,691
Whoa!

1090
01:05:24,901 --> 01:05:27,110
Grampa, Papa's in trouble.

1091
01:05:27,248 --> 01:05:28,905
Oh, I'll get right on that.

1092
01:05:29,043 --> 01:05:31,804
80HD, Papa's in trouble.

1093
01:05:34,151 --> 01:05:35,912
Cool.

1094
01:05:37,948 --> 01:05:39,398
Oopsies.

1095
01:05:44,230 --> 01:05:46,025
Yeah! Oh!

1096
01:05:52,584 --> 01:05:53,930
Looks bad, Dog Man.

1097
01:05:54,068 --> 01:05:56,104
We've only been partners
for like six minutes,

1098
01:05:56,242 --> 01:05:57,796
but it's been real.

1099
01:05:57,934 --> 01:05:59,694
I've matured and I respect you,

1100
01:05:59,832 --> 01:06:02,076
even if I'm only saying that
for dramatic impact

1101
01:06:02,214 --> 01:06:05,182
and I'm actually still evil
and rotten inside.

1102
01:06:06,632 --> 01:06:07,840
Dog Man?

1103
01:06:07,978 --> 01:06:09,980
Dog Man.

1104
01:06:13,190 --> 01:06:14,744
Wha...

1105
01:06:14,882 --> 01:06:16,711
Not in the mouth.

1106
01:06:16,849 --> 01:06:18,437
- Petey, look.
- Hold on, hold on.

1107
01:06:18,575 --> 01:06:20,439
I know you need to arrest me
for escaping from Cat Jail...

1108
01:06:22,130 --> 01:06:23,822
...but there are buildings
causing mayhem out there.

1109
01:06:23,960 --> 01:06:25,444
They're destroying the city.

1110
01:06:25,582 --> 01:06:27,377
Things can't possibly
get any worse.

1111
01:06:27,515 --> 01:06:29,379
Chief, turns out we actually

1112
01:06:29,517 --> 01:06:31,416
are out of toilet paper.

1113
01:06:42,427 --> 01:06:44,014
We're trapped.

1114
01:06:48,433 --> 01:06:49,710
What?

1115
01:06:51,712 --> 01:06:52,782
Good dog.

1116
01:06:54,542 --> 01:06:56,717
No, stop. Not now. Not now.

1117
01:06:58,097 --> 01:06:59,754
Yes. Finish them.

1118
01:07:03,137 --> 01:07:05,588
- Everyone, follow Dog Man.
-Me first.

1119
01:07:13,872 --> 01:07:16,599
Whoa!
We got a cave-in back here.

1120
01:07:17,393 --> 01:07:19,084
Aah! Run!

1121
01:07:24,054 --> 01:07:25,711
Climb up. Come on.

1122
01:07:30,302 --> 01:07:32,615
Gooba gabba.

1123
01:07:34,444 --> 01:07:36,170
Leave my papa alone.

1124
01:07:36,308 --> 01:07:37,136
Huh?

1125
01:07:38,966 --> 01:07:39,967
Hi, Papa.

1126
01:07:40,105 --> 01:07:41,382
No. Li'l Petey, no!

1127
01:07:41,520 --> 01:07:43,936
What the... Who's that?

1128
01:07:44,074 --> 01:07:46,076
Robo-Cat?

1129
01:07:46,939 --> 01:07:49,079
Flippy-ki-yay, Flippy flipper.

1130
01:07:49,217 --> 01:07:50,426
- Huh?
- Huh?

1131
01:07:50,564 --> 01:07:52,324
Yeah!

1132
01:07:57,260 --> 01:08:00,159
Gooba gabba!

1133
01:08:04,957 --> 01:08:06,234
Whoa.

1134
01:08:14,346 --> 01:08:16,659
-Gooba gabba.
- Go, go, go, go, go!

1135
01:08:18,695 --> 01:08:22,285
No! You can't escape me,
you sniveling little...

1136
01:08:22,423 --> 01:08:23,528
Come here!

1137
01:08:23,666 --> 01:08:26,289
Oh, do-gooders.

1138
01:08:26,427 --> 01:08:27,739
Li'l Petey!

1139
01:08:30,535 --> 01:08:33,192
Dog Man?

1140
01:08:34,159 --> 01:08:35,678
Papa.

1141
01:08:35,816 --> 01:08:37,127
Flippy is coming this way!

1142
01:08:37,265 --> 01:08:38,750
Oh, Robo-Cat.

1143
01:08:38,888 --> 01:08:41,269
Come out and play.

1144
01:08:41,407 --> 01:08:42,478
Everybody, clear out.

1145
01:08:42,616 --> 01:08:44,756
You'll never get away,
Robo-Cat.

1146
01:08:44,894 --> 01:08:46,171
Come on. Let's go.

1147
01:08:46,309 --> 01:08:48,380
I'll hunt you down
to my last breath.

1148
01:08:48,518 --> 01:08:49,864
What are you waiting for?

1149
01:08:50,002 --> 01:08:53,212
I'll never stop
till you're dead, Robo-Cat!

1150
01:08:53,350 --> 01:08:55,318
You better run, Papa.

1151
01:08:55,456 --> 01:08:57,009
It's me he wants.

1152
01:08:57,147 --> 01:08:59,943
Robo-Cat.

1153
01:09:00,081 --> 01:09:01,911
Oh, Robo-Cat.

1154
01:09:02,601 --> 01:09:04,085
Take him, Dog Man.

1155
01:09:04,223 --> 01:09:07,157
I'll create a distraction
and stall the fish.

1156
01:09:07,295 --> 01:09:08,400
Papa, wait.

1157
01:09:09,159 --> 01:09:12,404
Li'l Petey,
if something happens to me,

1158
01:09:12,542 --> 01:09:16,960
just try to be evil and stuff
and do the wrong thing.

1159
01:09:17,098 --> 01:09:18,928
- For me.
-Robo-Cat.

1160
01:09:19,066 --> 01:09:22,103
But, Papa,
Flippy's gonna destroy you.

1161
01:09:22,241 --> 01:09:23,311
I'll be okay, kid.

1162
01:09:23,449 --> 01:09:26,004
He's only after do-gooders.

1163
01:09:27,039 --> 01:09:29,110
And I'm no do-gooder.

1164
01:09:32,389 --> 01:09:34,668
Ah, Robo-Cat. There you are.

1165
01:09:34,806 --> 01:09:35,979
Go on, get out.

1166
01:09:36,117 --> 01:09:38,223
I want all you losers
out of here now.

1167
01:09:38,361 --> 01:09:40,846
Let's take cover in here.

1168
01:09:40,984 --> 01:09:45,057
Well, if it isn't
the mighty Robo-Cat.

1169
01:09:46,334 --> 01:09:48,474
Oh. Oh, you're much cuter
from a distance.

1170
01:09:48,613 --> 01:09:49,924
Can I say that? Do you mind?

1171
01:09:50,062 --> 01:09:52,375
'Cause up close,
you kind of look old and sad

1172
01:09:52,513 --> 01:09:54,929
and like you might have
unresolved daddy issues.

1173
01:09:55,067 --> 01:09:56,690
"Oh, Daddy, did you love me?"

1174
01:09:56,828 --> 01:09:58,554
No, he didn't! Oh, well.

1175
01:09:58,692 --> 01:09:59,796
Come along now.

1176
01:09:59,934 --> 01:10:02,696
Time to die.

1177
01:10:04,180 --> 01:10:05,008
Papa.

1178
01:10:05,146 --> 01:10:06,665
Well, that's out of our hands.

1179
01:10:06,803 --> 01:10:08,667
Nothing we can do about it.

1180
01:10:08,805 --> 01:10:10,980
- Good idea.
- Wait, what?

1181
01:10:12,119 --> 01:10:16,330
Now, how should I
get rid of this guy?

1182
01:10:16,468 --> 01:10:18,401
Tar pits? Nah.

1183
01:10:18,539 --> 01:10:20,576
Too slow and boring.

1184
01:10:20,714 --> 01:10:22,716
Explosives & Things? No.

1185
01:10:22,854 --> 01:10:25,270
Too fast and pedestrian.

1186
01:10:27,272 --> 01:10:31,000
Ooh. You, Robo-Cat,
are going in that volcano.

1187
01:10:31,138 --> 01:10:34,175
Then I'll take care of all
your dumb do-gooder friends.

1188
01:10:34,313 --> 01:10:36,005
How's that?

1189
01:10:36,799 --> 01:10:39,940
You're right, Dog Man. There's
always something you can do.

1190
01:10:49,846 --> 01:10:51,848
Wait a minute.
I-I'm so confused.

1191
01:10:51,986 --> 01:10:53,229
- About what?
- Look.

1192
01:10:53,367 --> 01:10:55,024
Dog Man and Petey
saved Li'l Petey.

1193
01:10:55,162 --> 01:10:56,750
And then Li'l Petey saved
Dog Man and Petey.

1194
01:10:56,888 --> 01:10:58,475
And then Petey saved
Li'l Petey and Dog Man.

1195
01:10:58,614 --> 01:11:01,202
Now Dog Man and Li'l Petey
are saving Petey.

1196
01:11:01,340 --> 01:11:03,584
I got one question:
Who's the hero?

1197
01:11:03,722 --> 01:11:06,656
All of 'em, Chief. All of 'em.

1198
01:11:11,661 --> 01:11:12,938
This is how it's gonna work.

1199
01:11:13,076 --> 01:11:15,044
As soon as he reaches
10,000 feet...

1200
01:11:15,182 --> 01:11:17,149
...he drops into the volcano.

1201
01:11:17,287 --> 01:11:20,118
Brilliant.

1202
01:11:44,073 --> 01:11:46,662
What? Oy. Aah! Oh!

1203
01:11:47,283 --> 01:11:48,318
What you doing?

1204
01:11:48,456 --> 01:11:50,320
What? Uh, well...

1205
01:11:52,115 --> 01:11:55,084
I'm very busy destroying
this Robo-Cat, actually.

1206
01:11:55,222 --> 01:11:56,913
- Why?
- 'Cause he's a jerk.

1207
01:11:57,051 --> 01:11:58,743
- Why?
- 'Cause he's trying to stop me.

1208
01:11:58,881 --> 01:12:00,779
Why? -'Cause I want
to destroy the city.

1209
01:12:00,917 --> 01:12:02,539
- Why?
- Because I want to.

1210
01:12:02,678 --> 01:12:03,817
- Why?
- Because.

1211
01:12:03,955 --> 01:12:06,543
All right? Because I was...

1212
01:12:06,682 --> 01:12:07,717
I was mad.

1213
01:12:07,855 --> 01:12:10,133
- Why?
- Because.

1214
01:12:10,271 --> 01:12:11,617
'Cause...

1215
01:12:11,756 --> 01:12:14,103
Because no one likes me,
do they?

1216
01:12:14,241 --> 01:12:16,415
- Why?
- I don't know.

1217
01:12:16,553 --> 01:12:17,693
You tell me.

1218
01:12:17,831 --> 01:12:19,349
No one's ever liked me.

1219
01:12:19,487 --> 01:12:21,248
Even back when
I was in the school.

1220
01:12:21,386 --> 01:12:23,112
All the other fish,

1221
01:12:23,250 --> 01:12:25,562
they used to call me...

1222
01:12:25,701 --> 01:12:27,219
Fatty Fish Face.

1223
01:12:27,357 --> 01:12:28,911
Imagine that.

1224
01:12:29,049 --> 01:12:31,603
Fatty Fish Face!

1225
01:12:31,741 --> 01:12:33,950
Maybe, Flippy...

1226
01:12:34,675 --> 01:12:37,022
Maybe you just need a friend.

1227
01:12:38,437 --> 01:12:39,507
Oh, yeah.

1228
01:12:39,645 --> 01:12:40,750
I got something
that'll cheer you up.

1229
01:12:40,888 --> 01:12:42,545
What's that?

1230
01:12:42,683 --> 01:12:44,271
Your manifesto?

1231
01:12:44,409 --> 01:12:45,444
I made you a book.

1232
01:12:45,582 --> 01:12:46,756
Do you want to read it?

1233
01:12:48,447 --> 01:12:50,277
Yeah, okay. Sure.

1234
01:12:54,039 --> 01:12:56,870
"Flippy and me
flew up to a star.

1235
01:12:57,008 --> 01:13:00,045
"They had a swing set,
so we swinged on it.

1236
01:13:00,183 --> 01:13:03,773
"I fell off,
but Flippy saved me.

1237
01:13:03,911 --> 01:13:06,742
"Flippy and me
went under the sea.

1238
01:13:06,880 --> 01:13:09,123
"Then we ate five soups.

1239
01:13:09,261 --> 01:13:10,469
The end."

1240
01:13:10,607 --> 01:13:12,437
Did you like it?

1241
01:13:16,130 --> 01:13:17,960
Oh, you poor little thing.

1242
01:13:18,098 --> 01:13:20,825
There, there, now.

1243
01:13:20,963 --> 01:13:22,274
Oh, no. My powers.

1244
01:13:22,412 --> 01:13:24,276
My evil powers--
they're fading.

1245
01:13:24,414 --> 01:13:26,727
- Isn't that good?
- Not for Robo-Cat.

1246
01:13:26,865 --> 01:13:28,660
N-N-No! Wait! Don't!

1247
01:13:28,798 --> 01:13:29,695
Oh, no.

1248
01:13:29,834 --> 01:13:32,319
Dog Man. Dog Man?

1249
01:14:01,141 --> 01:14:03,419
Whoa!

1250
01:14:14,016 --> 01:14:15,638
Good job, 80HD.

1251
01:14:17,191 --> 01:14:18,744
Papa!

1252
01:14:18,883 --> 01:14:21,161
Li'l Petey!

1253
01:14:23,025 --> 01:14:24,198
What?

1254
01:14:27,719 --> 01:14:29,203
There they are. Step on it.

1255
01:14:39,524 --> 01:14:41,319
This is Sarah Hatoff
on the scene

1256
01:14:41,457 --> 01:14:43,804
as the chief arrests
Flippy the Fish.

1257
01:14:51,018 --> 01:14:52,261
Oh.

1258
01:14:52,399 --> 01:14:54,228
Flippy the Fish,
I hereby arrest you

1259
01:14:54,366 --> 01:14:55,574
for the following things.

1260
01:14:55,712 --> 01:14:57,369
Yeah, yeah,
no need to list it all.

1261
01:14:57,507 --> 01:14:59,061
I'm familiar.

1262
01:15:03,099 --> 01:15:04,031
Hey, Chief.

1263
01:15:04,169 --> 01:15:06,068
- Smile.
- Oh.

1264
01:15:08,760 --> 01:15:10,624
Well done, Dog Man. You did it.

1265
01:15:12,246 --> 01:15:14,007
Well, go on, arrest him.

1266
01:15:15,732 --> 01:15:17,010
- Dog Man, wh-what are you...
-Whoa, whoa, whoa.

1267
01:15:17,148 --> 01:15:18,149
What are you doing?

1268
01:15:18,287 --> 01:15:19,633
The governor saw
the whole thing.

1269
01:15:19,771 --> 01:15:21,842
Petey's been pardoned
for being a do-gooder.

1270
01:15:21,980 --> 01:15:23,602
Wait. "Cerealously"?

1271
01:15:23,740 --> 01:15:25,673
And I'm not just saying that
because it's an election year.

1272
01:15:25,811 --> 01:15:27,952
Where are the cameras?

1273
01:15:29,539 --> 01:15:30,540
Okay.

1274
01:15:30,678 --> 01:15:32,163
Well, Petey,
looks like you turned out

1275
01:15:32,301 --> 01:15:33,750
to be a do-gooder after all.

1276
01:15:33,889 --> 01:15:35,752
- Do-gooder?
- Can it, fish!

1277
01:15:35,891 --> 01:15:38,272
He's a do-gooder!

1278
01:15:38,410 --> 01:15:40,896
All right, stop!
Stop calling me a do-gooder.

1279
01:15:41,034 --> 01:15:43,070
I'm not a do-gooder.
I'm not, see?

1280
01:15:43,208 --> 01:15:45,279
I'm mean. I'm selfish.

1281
01:15:45,417 --> 01:15:48,179
And I... I just want
everything for myself.

1282
01:15:48,317 --> 01:15:52,528
Which...
which includes Li'l Petey.

1283
01:15:52,666 --> 01:15:54,150
Come on, Li'l Petey.

1284
01:15:57,498 --> 01:15:58,672
Okay, Papa.

1285
01:16:00,329 --> 01:16:02,918
Well, this is goodbye.

1286
01:16:03,539 --> 01:16:04,678
Say goodbye.

1287
01:16:07,267 --> 01:16:09,165
Goodbye, Dog Man.

1288
01:16:16,897 --> 01:16:18,381
Well, hey, how about
a celebration, huh?

1289
01:16:18,519 --> 01:16:20,038
Let's all go back
to the station,

1290
01:16:20,176 --> 01:16:21,315
completely ignoring the fact

1291
01:16:21,453 --> 01:16:22,627
that half the city
is destroyed.

1292
01:16:24,215 --> 01:16:25,664
Come on, boo.

1293
01:16:32,499 --> 01:16:34,950
- Hey, that's Grampa.
- Whoa.

1294
01:16:36,227 --> 01:16:37,262
What?

1295
01:16:37,400 --> 01:16:38,815
Where's he going?

1296
01:16:38,954 --> 01:16:40,472
Where'd he get that truck?

1297
01:16:40,610 --> 01:16:42,267
Beats me.

1298
01:16:45,236 --> 01:16:47,824
Where's all our stuff?

1299
01:16:47,963 --> 01:16:49,102
Not again.

1300
01:17:01,010 --> 01:17:06,360
He took everything,
but he didn't want my comics?

1301
01:17:07,983 --> 01:17:09,915
Kid, it's not you.

1302
01:17:10,054 --> 01:17:13,505
Some people just won't change.

1303
01:17:24,447 --> 01:17:26,760
"Undo"?

1304
01:17:33,077 --> 01:17:34,492
Never.

1305
01:17:36,873 --> 01:17:39,324
Let's go. We can't stay here.

1306
01:17:42,086 --> 01:17:43,397
You were right, Papa.

1307
01:17:43,535 --> 01:17:45,882
- About what?
- The world.

1308
01:17:46,021 --> 01:17:48,471
It's nothing but mud puddles

1309
01:17:48,609 --> 01:17:51,440
and pollution

1310
01:17:51,578 --> 01:17:53,304
and weeds.

1311
01:17:53,442 --> 01:17:55,754
Look. Even the weeds are dying.

1312
01:17:58,895 --> 01:18:00,483
Hmm.

1313
01:18:05,454 --> 01:18:07,490
- Hey, kid.
- What?

1314
01:18:07,628 --> 01:18:09,389
Look up.

1315
01:18:11,391 --> 01:18:13,151
You want to know something,
kid?

1316
01:18:13,289 --> 01:18:14,670
What, Papa?

1317
01:18:14,808 --> 01:18:17,431
This world has
a lot of problems,

1318
01:18:17,569 --> 01:18:20,572
but it can never be
a horrible place.

1319
01:18:21,435 --> 01:18:23,713
'Cause you're in it.

1320
01:18:26,302 --> 01:18:27,614
Hey, Papa?

1321
01:18:28,960 --> 01:18:31,135
So is Dog Man.

1322
01:18:47,806 --> 01:18:49,153
Hey, Dog Man.

1323
01:18:51,051 --> 01:18:55,676
Look, I know we're archrivals
and all, but, uh, I...

1324
01:18:55,814 --> 01:18:56,850
I was thinking.

